    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Finally, I can catch my breath.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't think I've talked so much in my entire life. And I've got another lifetime's worth of talking to do tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. How about we trade jobs, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll greet the Kazdelian delegation. You deal with the thirteen nomadic abbeys scheduled to arrive tomorrow. How's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "All this running around is hard on my old bones.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That will not be necessary, Reverend Patrizion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How is communicating with our new Sarkaz friends?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not all the Sarkaz have set hatred aside. That ancient Revenant with Speaker Wi\u0161'adel, for example, got rather worked up at the mere sight of the Matriarch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the Speaker shut them up. She's been so magnanimous that I'm having trouble reconciling my impression with the rumors I've heard of her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "text": "The chief spokesman for the Kazdelian delegation is a Lich by the name of Fremont. I wish you could have seen it\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A three-hour debate in which he engaged seventeen cardinals from the First and Sixth Tribunals in a, well, 'animated exchange of opinions', encompassing everything from politics to the Law, from faith to life and death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "text": "Small wonder that whole procession of cardinals was spotted around the guava juice machine afterwards. They must've been soothing their parched lips and throats.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such energy at his age! I envy the man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Long story short, Kazdel accepted our proposal. The Royal Court will review the legacy of royal authority, and the Sarkaz will unite through the mediation of Laterano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have also spoken to the Empresses' Voice. The Leithanian delegation will arrive at the Holy City early tomorrow morning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that's something you don't see every day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember how few answered the call of the first Summit of Nations two years ago. Most thought that the Lateran Declaration was little more than a piece of paper, empty posturing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Empress Ewigegnade declined our invitation then. This time, she is proactively asking to take part in the Summit of Nations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even Empress Grimmacht, who has long been out of the public eye, came out of seclusion to join the envoy and visit Laterano...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a strong show of good faith from Leithanien.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shall we say the second Summit of Nations has already met expectations?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exceeded them, Cardinal Velliv.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Columbia, Ursus, Yan, even distant \u00c6gir... all nations that should be here are now present.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's like a dream.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only the inevitable result of Laterano's development over the ages.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "The prophesied calamity draws near. The black snow on the ice of Sami, the hole in the sky above Leithanien, even the raging tides that dash against the coast, are all portents of its inevitable arrival.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the face of calamity, everyone wants order\u2014Lateran order.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're correct. But even after all our preparation, the sight still feels... unfamiliar.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it's like that for you, imagine how it must be for everyone else. Even if one has heard of the path that Laterano has paved in response to the prophesied calamity countless times during one's enlightenment...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "One cannot help but hesitate when coming face-to-face with the ultimate end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about yourself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's bad form to flaunt one's age, but when you get to be my age, there's not much to hesitate about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you ready to retire?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can hardly bite through a cactus tart these days. This summit may be the last thing I can do for Laterano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That might have more to do with your taste in food, Reverend... I would have a hard time biting through one of those, er, cactus tarts you're talking about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are aware that all the cactus tarts among the refreshments were made specially for you? Literally no one else in all of Laterano has any interest in them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You must be joking. The cactus tarts were a recommendation from an old friend, a true connoisseur of desserts... what was his name again...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doesn't matter. Back to the topic at hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "The doubts among the people make the subsequent ceremony at the Shrine of Nurtury all the more important.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "We must show everyone, in the most forceful manner, the potential of Laterano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. I'll get on the handover of the Seventh Tribunal immediately. When the Summit of Nations gets underway, I will head to the Shrine and ensure that the ceremony is executed without a hitch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "No need to rush.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. Never mind. Young people are all the same... they complain a lot, but they have no patience when the time for action comes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you reminded of your <i>Fia?</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe she has returned, according to the mission logs?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. We'll have a family get-together tomorrow... I hope she likes my gift.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
