        "pfrom": "235,0",
        "pto": "235,0",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Cardinal Lemuen, your presence is required at Via Jovita, Pagus Stevonus, to investigate a possible bombing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#14$2",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "switch": false,
        "pfrom": "235,0",
        "pto": "235,0",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Reverend Patrizion? I don't believe this was on today's schedule.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#14$2",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "switch": true,
        "pfrom": "235,0",
        "pto": "235,0",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "You may not understand, as you were recently created, but emergency assignments take precedence over all other arrangements, regardless of organ.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "switch": false,
        "pfrom": "235,0",
        "pto": "235,0",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "An emergency assignment...? But where did this decision come from? Is there any documentation to reference?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "switch": true,
        "pfrom": "235,0",
        "pto": "235,0",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether a situation is an emergency or not is always self-evident. There is no need for additional determination.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone of unknown identity and in possession of unregistered explosives has been seen in public multiple times without Notarial Hall oversight\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a grave threat to the order of Laterano. The centuries-long peace of the Holy City must not be broken by an illegal explosion during the Summit of Nations, with the eyes of all lands upon us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "The suspect has been sighted on Via Jovita in Pagus Stevonus. You are the nearest officer of the Curia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "Proceed to the scene immediately. Your aide and Notarial Hall executors will join you, ETA approximately ten minutes following your arrival.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#8$2",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "switch": false,
        "pfrom": "235,0",
        "pto": "235,0",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#8$2",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "switch": true,
        "pfrom": "235,0",
        "pto": "235,0",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "...Lemuen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#8$2",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "switch": false,
        "pfrom": "235,0",
        "pto": "235,0",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "What else do I need to know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#8$2",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "switch": true,
        "pfrom": "235,0",
        "pto": "235,0",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "I had meant to congratulate you on your creation... but I guess it should wait for tomorrow's gathering.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#11$2",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "switch": false,
        "pfrom": "235,0",
        "pto": "235,0",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Will you be there? We all know you've only gotten busier as your retirement draws near, and you always...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#11$2",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "switch": true,
        "pfrom": "235,0",
        "pto": "235,0",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Always put my duties first? I can't deny that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've postponed meetings with old friends so many times that I can hardly remember their names, leaving me too embarrassed to meet them anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'll try to make the gathering tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Patrizion"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1811_1#1$2",
        "posfrom": "-200,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "interlude",
        "channel": 3,
        "type": 3,
        "slot": "m",
        "switch": false,
        "pfrom": "235,0",
        "pto": "235,0",
        "name": "avg_4194_rmixer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Take care, Reverend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll head to Via Jovita immediately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
