        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(No no no, Lemuen, you misunderstand...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I'm fine, but there's a... situation. I need to stay hidden and keep quiet.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "See you at Fiammetta's thing, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sure.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Take care.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
