    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1802_1#1$2",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1801_1#1$2",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1802_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's here! He might be whispering, but he can't fool my ears!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Proud Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1801_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't need you to guess where he is!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Obstinate Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's not behind the curtains or the pillars...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Obstinate Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "'This wardrobe is only half his height. There's no way he could hide in here.'\u2014Is what he'd want us to think!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Obstinate Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1802_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a dummy!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Proud Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1801_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not that he's dumb, it's that we're too smart!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Obstinate Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1802_1#1$2",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "text": "We found you, Senior Nurturer!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Proud Child and Obstinate Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1800_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "-50,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1800_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright, you got me\u2014thirty extra minutes of free time today!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1802_1#1$2",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1801_1#1$2",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Proud Child and Obstinate Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1802_1#1$2",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's play 'Halo', Senior Nurturer!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Proud Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be the first to get in the bottle, the first one out the front, and the first one you hug! Then we'll hold hands and meet the other kids behind when they come out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Proud Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1785_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you bothering Andoain again, children?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1800_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They just want to play a little longer. It's all fine. Giselle, Romya, go make your preparations at the Hall of Enlightenment. We can start the game once I get there, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1802_1#1$2",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1801_1#1$2",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1785_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you ever say no to the children?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess that's why they trust you and look up to you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just a few weeks ago, they were terrified of these unfamiliar halls. It was a struggle just to give them a change of clothes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, they feel at home... all thanks to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1800_1#12$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't do anything, except stay with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1785_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're very much like the Matriarch, down to your humility. Just having you with them makes all the difference.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it not your companionship that helped the mother you and the Matriarch brought back through the worst?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I remember the first thing the surgeon did after leaving the operating room was to check if he still had his halo.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "text": "He could not understand how the mother managed to survive with her baby, after her abdomen was impaled by a spear.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was a miracle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1800_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll call it a miracle once she's successfully given birth. Meanwhile, I will continue to care for her as best as I can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1785_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm... beginning to understand why the Matriarch holds you in such high regard. It is reassuring to know that you are in charge of the most important duty of the Nativity, the delivery of the child.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Shrine of Nurtury will be ready for full operation if the Nativity goes well. Every child born on Terra henceforth shall have the protection and blessing of the Holy City.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "text": "That will be the true miracle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1800_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope so... I do hope so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andoain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1785_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must not keep you any longer. Giselle and Romya are still waiting for you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nurturer"
    },
