    {
        "text": "It's quiet...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lemuen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "A procession of halos stretches from one end of the street to the other. No one stops, and there is no commotion."
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone may step out of the procession to enter a passing confessional, or pick up an ice cream cone from a dessert cart, before continuing on their soundless parade."
    },
    {
        "text": "Silence and order. This is how things have always been in Laterano, the Holy City."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
